    "content" : "I received a Spark Core that I helped fund on Kickstarter in June. They definitely have the best packaging of any of the electronics projects I&#39;ve backed.  When I try it out, I&#39;ll make another post. I should finish up a blog post tonight on something I&#39;ve made with the electric imp so we can see how a product made a year and a half later compares. I&#39;m going to guess that this board will be easier to use since it doesn&#39;t require me to learn a new programming language (I still have no idea why electric imp chose squirrel as their language and their documentation isn&#39;t very pretty either.). ",
    "objectType" : "note",
